# Case 3: synthetic NLA data vector with the fixed Gaussian covariance (a teaching configuration, not the published analysis).
# The synthetic vector is the model's own mean at the declared fiducial point; all 400 xi and 80 Map3 rows are retained.
# Normalized fixed Gaussian with the complete joint cross-covariance; no Hartlap, Percival or PME correction and no compression.
# Source n(z): the recorded demonstration processing of the released nz_source table (0.04 per cent of the bin-1 area clipped).
# Priors differ from the published analysis by design: 10^9 A_s sampled uniformly (sigma8 derived), mnu = 0.06 fixed.
# scripts/convert_desy3_fits.py writes every data/ input named here from the released FITS files.

data_file = des_y3_nla_synthetic.datavector
mask_file =
compression_file =
mock_count = 0
parameter_count = 0
source_ntomo = 4
n_theta = 20
theta_min_arcmin = 2.5
theta_max_arcmin = 250.0
map3_radii_arcmin = 7.0 14.0 25.0 40.0
nz_source_file = des_y3_source.nz
nz_source_bin_width = 0.01
cov_file = des_y3_joint.cov
